Recommends: konsole
Description: CZD Purple terminal and toolkit files (Konsole, GTK, Xresources, vim, Wireshark)
 Konsole colour scheme and profile, GTK 3 and 4 theme, Xresources block, vim
 and neovim colour scheme, and Wireshark colouring rules, all generated from
 the CZD token file. Ships the sixteen-slot instrument palette.
